{
  "assembly_notes": "Vertical single-acting hydraulic bottle/ram jack. One rigid jack_frame root carries the painted cylinder shell, the horizontal hand-pump body, the manifold and the routed hose. ram_stage_count nested telescopic ram stages extend upward: stage 0 is a PRISMATIC (+z) child of jack_frame and stage i is a PRISMATIC (+z) child of stage i-1, each with a real guide land that stays inside the next larger bore over the whole stroke. The head_fitting rides the topmost stage; screw_extension additionally adds a REVOLUTE screw joint about +z. pump_handle is a REVOLUTE (+y) lever in a real two-eared clevis and release_valve is a REVOLUTE (+y) knob on the pump end block. Four component slots vary without touching the mechanism: ram_stage (stage tube form), head_fitting (load interface), pump_drive (lever vs air-over-hydraulic module) and base_mount (base footprint). body_height_m, bore_radius_m and pump_reach_m are independent continuous parameters that derive stage lengths, stroke, radii, clevis position, handle length, hose routing and base footprint; palette and label marks are non-core.",
